{"parse": {"title": "TTS-02", "pageid": 141708, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-01\" title=\"TTS-01\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TTS-02</span><a href=\"/wiki/TTS-03\" title=\"TTS-03\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TTS</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">02</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.9D.A5.E8.87.AA.E4.B8.9C.E6.96.B9\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"来自东方\">来自东方</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 来自东方</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Eastward</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>—<span class=\"color-value\"></span>您<span class=\"color-value\"></span>瞧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>愿<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>遗<span class=\"color-value\"></span>忘<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3810102</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650220.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-650220.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650220.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650220.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-650220.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650220.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/HeadIconSmall-650220.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650220.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……按照原定计划，我会在这个车站与奠基石会合，并通过你获取前往建筑的准确路线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650221.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-650221.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650221.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650221.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-650221.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650221.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-650221.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650221.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>但现在显然有人失了约。不如我们先确认一下路线安排吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_at_02.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_at_02\"><img alt=\"3_8_at_02\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Cg-3_8_at_02.png/600px-Cg-3_8_at_02.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Cg-3_8_at_02.png/900px-Cg-3_8_at_02.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3c/Cg-3_8_at_02.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_at_02.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>当然，沿着古尔尼恰街往北走，然后往东……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>昏暗的房间里，尘埃在日光中缓慢沉浮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>电报机发出断续的滴答声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>您能准确辨别方向吗？请不要误会，我只是例行对您的方向判断能力做一次风险评估。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>抱歉，这里的建筑结构有些异常，信号一直时断时续——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>你好？你好？……你好？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>很遗憾，回应她的只有空洞的电流回声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/28/HeadIconSmall-302001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">柏林以东：</div><div>噢，这下麻烦了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_20\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-650213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-650213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fd/HeadIconSmall-650213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……柏林以东小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对话猝不及防中断。蓝图看了一会儿手里的通讯器，又举起它晃了晃。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>通讯器依然坚守沉默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>报告里仅标注了大致区域，没有精准的路线图与地址，我没法这么大海捞针地找……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>看样子只能祈祷奠基石还认得路。约定的时间已经过了，希望她没有因为过劳晕倒在布鲁塞尔的办公室里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她有些茫然地看向前方，拿出随身携带的记事本。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-typerbg.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"typerbg\"><img alt=\"typerbg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/600px-Cg-typerbg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/900px-Cg-typerbg.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/38/Cg-typerbg.png/1200px-Cg-typerbg.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>1996年4月18日</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>天气 阴</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抵达诺瓦米奇的第3天。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>浑浊的河水、公路，徘徊不去的雾气……或许只是因为心情低落，在我看来，这里的一切似乎都是灰色的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而我即将前往一栋灰色的建筑，在那里与我的同伴碰头。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_20\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">流浪汉：</div><div>呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人坐在车站唯一完好的椅子上，一个酒瓶从他的方向滚向少女。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你的酒，先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">醉酒的男人：</div><div>……谢谢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人咕噜咽下一大口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就流浪汉而言，他似乎有些太年轻了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>现在是早上九点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就买醉而言，时间也似乎有些太早了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">醉酒的男人：</div><div>哦……已经九点了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">醉酒的男人：</div><div>早上九点，晚上九点……我们都喝“野牛草”，在舞厅跳到天亮。日子没什么不同。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">醉酒的男人：</div><div>天亮咯。天亮就该回家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人站起身来，伸了个懒腰——作为对一天的告别。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他身后矗立着一排排废弃的楼宇。柱子和墙壁裸露着，如同某种庞然巨物遗留的骨骸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>男人一手拎着酒瓶，走得很慢、很慢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，他的身影消失在地平线的尽头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……不喜欢这里的理由又多了一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>嗯……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下雨了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>潮湿在灰色的路面缓慢铺开，形成深浅不一的黑色斑块。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……那一天也是从这样的雨开始的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汉娜：</div><div>艾达……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">汉娜：</div><div>告诉我，这不是世界末日——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>声音在雨中变得遥远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>明明只过去了短短数月，她却有些记不清那张脸的样子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c0/HeadIconSmall-650214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>汉娜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>耳畔传来一连串熟悉的声响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洁白的构件在头顶徐徐展开，将飘零的细雨温柔挡下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……奠基石？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>好久不见，蓝图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>一直淋雨可不好，小心——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>哈啾！感冒……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>呵呵，材料部还是一如既往地慷慨，又把他们淘汰下来的样品打包送给我了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_8_bg_20\"><img alt=\"3_8_bg_20\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/600px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/900px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/67/Cg-3_8_bg_20.png/1200px-Cg-3_8_bg_20.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>膜面预张力不足，连接节点太过随意，排水坡度也不够……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她给出了冷酷无情的点评。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>嗯……你的判断完全正确。作为一种新兴材料，玻璃纤维布确实有这些缺点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>……只是没想到它们这么快就被我验证了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>看到你还是老样子，我真是倍感遗憾，老同事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>不过，若是抛开我对你的成见不谈……我喜欢它的外观，很像白鹳张开的羽翼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师笑着朝她眨了眨眼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我知道你喜欢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>雨似乎小了一点。走，我们出发吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>右手在半空中划出一道弧形，建筑师收起了白色的立面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你知道路？太好了……不愧是本地人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>当然。如果没记错的话，那栋建筑应该就在不远处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>它是诺瓦米奇有名的“闹鬼圣地”。小时候，我们总爱去那里捉迷藏。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>虽说没能联系上柏林以东小姐，但我已经提前画好了路线图——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师打开制图箱，从中掏出一张又一张稿纸、破损的画板、圆规……以及小半截树枝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你的箱子简直像个黑洞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>找到了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314011.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314011.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-314011.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314011.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>看——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>混乱的线条，无序的几何组成了一幅不可名状的抽象作品。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>抱歉，我喜欢在笔记本里记录一些乱七八糟的灵感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>只需要把目光锁定在那些蓝色的线条上……嗯……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一转眼，建筑师已经坐在凭空变出的白色石墩上，手里端着一杯热气腾腾的咖啡。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650219.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650219.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/44/HeadIconSmall-650219.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650219.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……你在做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>喝咖啡，或者说——在条件允许的情况下，尽量维持生命体征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>如你所见，我刚从总部的修缮工事里被抽调过来——他们希望将整栋委员会大楼迁移至未被影响的区域。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>直到现在，我已经整整48小时没合过眼了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师语调虚浮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>请节哀。毕竟你是基金会目前活下来的、唯一还能被称为建筑师的个体。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>而你是唯一还能站在这儿呼吸的监理工程师，这让我们变成了一对独一无二的搭档，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……对此我深表遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>我很好奇，你的咖啡是从哪里来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>刚才来的路上顺手买的，就在路边那家咖啡厅。老板娘是本地人，有三个女儿和一条叫莱卡的狗……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>好吧，这下我算是知道你那些涂鸦的灵感来源了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>抱歉……我的血管里流淌着20%的卡布奇诺、30%的美式和50%的冷萃，我需要借助它们来提神醒脑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蓝图看向同伴日渐消瘦的身体和愈发凸显的黑眼圈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>总有一天你会被咖啡因毒死的，我确信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她叹息着，将视线再度移回路线图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>线条、水渍与色彩纠缠在一起，彼此重叠，又彼此解离……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到最后，清晰的线条浮出水面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-650211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-650211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/HeadIconSmall-650211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>不错，很精确。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"650212.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"650212.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-650212.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-650212.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>你总能在我耐心耗尽前，唤醒我对你专业性仅存的一点信任。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>从图像来看，它位于旧厂区外东北方向。至于具体的位置……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她面朝标识指向的方向，一侧瞳孔涌起变幻的图形。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老旧的城市在雾气中呼吸着，风从断裂的石墙穿过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>废墟、商店、民居……所有景观皆退为黑白的线条。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>视线缓慢流动。这里是剪力墙，那儿又是楼板……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>直到——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>有一个地方无法被我的视线所穿透，我想我找到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>完美同步——刚好一杯咖啡的时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师吸吮完最后一滴咖啡，原本无神的双眼慢慢亮了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她“噌”地站起身。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>充能完毕，我已经时刻准备好长途跋涉了！<br />刚才你说的位置，旧厂区东北方向？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>来之前我已经熟记了当地的区域图，对那个地方略微有些印象。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>很好，现在你是我们之中最了解诺瓦米奇的人了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我八岁便随父母移居海外，对这里现在的人和物可以说是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>一无所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她站在一片灰色中，身着时髦的棕黄外衣，手提公文包，蹬着一双精致的长靴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切都显得格格不入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>难怪你说话没有口音。那你在这里有任何……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她眼中闪过一丝迟疑，压下了即将脱口而出的言辞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我知道你想问什么。我看过柏林以东小姐的名单，那栋建筑里没有我认识的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我曾经熟识的人……都死了。或者谨慎一点来说，失联了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">蓝图：</div><div>……抱歉，我很遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>不必道歉，这不是你的错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>我们都知道谁应该为此负责，谁又应该为此付出代价，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>建筑师伸了个懒腰，拎起制图箱，慢慢朝前走去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那一刻，她的背影仿佛与先前的流浪汉奇异地重叠，却又迥然相异。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a3/HeadIconSmall-314010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>走吧，该干活了，我的搭档。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5c/HeadIconSmall-314001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">奠基石：</div><div>说起来，我和那个地方还有一些故事……可以在路上慢慢讲给你听。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TTS-02"}}